00:36:12,848 --> 00:36:13,768
grep takes two arguments:

753
00:36:13,788 --> 00:36:17,791
a pattern and a file or a list of files that you wanted to search in.

754
00:36:18,332 --> 00:36:21,874
And it will print out all of the lines that match the pattern that you gave in.

755
00:36:22,294 --> 00:36:24,456
So,
in this case these lines all match 3,

