you learn how to write these patterns.

1123
00:55:17,087 --> 00:55:20,889
What this will end up doing is taking all the logs from my SSH server,

1124
00:55:21,449 --> 00:55:28,712
disconnected from is the line that gets printed when someone tries to log in but then either ended their session or failed to log in.

1125
